{"id":"chemy35-19-3","sourceHash":"867404fadb9bc6ac9b0639ef0a8f875bac56605a850c325c4081b01f64f5e75f","links":[{"concept":"金的硫代硫酸配合物","aliases":[],"subquestions":["3-1-1"],"strength":3,"confidence":0.96,"reason":"Cu(II)氧化金而Au(I)/Cu(I)分别形成硫代硫酸配合物，O2再生氨合Cu(II)，需写两步。","evidence":[{"kind":"answer","quote":"Au + Cu(NH3)42+ + 4S2O32- = [Au(S2O3)2]3- + [Cu(S2O3)2]3- + 4NH3"}]},{"concept":"催化循环","aliases":[],"subquestions":["3-1-1"],"strength":2,"confidence":0.96,"reason":"铜氨/硫代硫酸配合物在Cu(II)/Cu(I)间循环，O2为终端氧化剂促溶金。","evidence":[{"kind":"answer","quote":"4[Cu(S2O3)2]3- + O2 + 16NH3 + 2H2O"}]},{"concept":"硫代硫酸盐的氧化还原反应","aliases":[],"subquestions":["3-1-2"],"strength":2,"confidence":0.96,"reason":"过高温度时Cu(II)氨配合物与S2O3²-转为CuS和SO4²-，破坏浸出体系。","evidence":[{"kind":"answer","quote":"Cu(NH3)42+ + S2O32- + H2O = CuS + SO42- + 2NH3 + 2NH4+"}]},{"concept":"氯的氟氧化物的制备","aliases":[],"subquestions":["3-2-1","3-2-2","3-2-3"],"strength":2,"confidence":0.96,"reason":"由价态/杂化条件推断FClO3、ClO2F及ClOF3，分别写强酸氟化、AgF2氧化氟化和Cl2O氟化反应。","evidence":[{"kind":"answer","quote":"Cl2O + 2F2 = ClF + ClOF3"}]}],"promptVersion":"knowledge-multimodal-v1","model":"codex-source-review","reviewMethod":"Direct AI reading of source text and question/answer images.","analyzedAt":"2026-10-20T01:27:03.821465+00:00"}